{"t":"Rascacoon","s":"rascacoon-d9ea5","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Rascacoon_map_5bc6f6.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Rascacoon</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Rascacoon map\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"252\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rascacoon_map_5bc6f6.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tik%27hi%20Tak%27he\">Tik'hi Tak'he</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pirat%20Mine\">Pirat Mine</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/a-pirates-tail-quest\">A Pirate's Tail Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/rascoohan-outfits-quest\">Rascoohan Outfits Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.60.10463<br/>November 30, 2020<br/>Winter Update 2020</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n<b>Rascacoon</b> is a small island just north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kilmaresh\">Kilmaresh</a>. The island inhabitants are called the <i>Rascoohan</i> and migrated to this island from a place called <i>Washingstone</i>. They are under constant attack by the <a href=\"#/wiki/Corym\">Pirats</a>.\n</p><p>Rascacoon can be accessed through the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirat%20Mine\">Pirat Mine</a> and the Exotic Cave Spider Cave, which is accessed from <a href=\"#/wiki/Issavi\">Issavi</a>. It's also possible to take a shortcut there with <a href=\"#/wiki/Eustacio\">Eustacio</a> if he trusts you. \n</p><p>Access to the island is obtained through <a href=\"#/quest/a-pirates-tail-quest\">A Pirate's Tail Quest</a>. Most of the quest also takes part here.\n</p></div>","quests":["a-pirates-tail-quest","rascoohan-outfits-quest"]}